card.text:
When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token and attach this to it.
Equipped creature has +2/+3, vigilance and "other Soldiers and Mercenaries you control have ward {1}."
Equip {3}

Equip {2}
Equipped creature has +0/+2 and is a Paladin in addition to its other types.
Sacrifice Justicar's Armour: Equipped creature gains indestructible until end of turn.

Ward {2}
Whenever a creature with power 2 or less enters under your control, draw a card. This ability only triggers once a turn.
Other creatures you control with power 2 or less have ward {2}.

Ward {4}
Ikari, Secretkeeper can't be blocked.
Whenever Ikari deals combat damage to a player, look at that player's hand and exile a nonland card. That card can be played by any player whenever they could play a sorcery for {X}, where X is its mana value plus 2.

Equip {1}
Equipped creature gains +2/+0.
Whenever equipped creature deals damage to a creature, tap that creature and unequip The Black Tentacle. It doesn't untap during it's controller's untap step as long as The Black Tentacle is unequipped.

Ward {3}
All other players may only attack you with up to two creatures.
Whenever Pertuari, the Last Aboleth attacks, you may sacrifice an Island. If you do, it can't be blocked until end of turn.
